                "text": "Congressional Leadership must act to stop health care prices from increasing this fall.\n\nIf the ACA tax credit expires, health care premiums for working-class families will skyrocket next year, with some families seeing their insurance bills nearly double \u2b07\ufe0f\n\nhttps://t.co/FtVyLmmtAT",
