                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "\ud83d\udea8 In a matter of DAYS, tens of thousands of Nevada families will receive notifications that their health care costs are about to skyrocket.\n\nI joined Southern Hills hospital this morning to sound the alarm on the expiration of the ACA Enhanced Premiums Tax Credits which allow 85,000 Nevadans to afford health care.\n\nAllowing these credits to expire will only increase costs for ALL Nevadans. Congressional leadership must act to stop this looming health care crisis.",
