                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Allowing the ACA Enhanced Premium Tax Credit credits to expire will cost ALL Nevadans.  \n\nA 60 year old couple making $82,000/year would see their health care premiums could SKYROCKET by $12,392 annually.  \n\nWe want Republicans to join us in stopping this before it\u2019s too late. https://t.co/PtAfNGtd2x",
