                "reply_count": 5,
                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "This is what we are fighting for: between rising premiums and Republican politicians taking away ACA tax credits, families could see their health costs go up approximately $450 a month.\n\nRepublicans in Washington shut down the government after giving permanent, HUGE tax breaks to the wealthiest Americans. Now, they are ripping health care away from millions of Americans \u2014 we will ALL pay for that!",
