                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Health care costs are going up for ALL Nevadans. Insurance premiums are going to rise an average of 26% and the expiration of ACA tax credits is going to make it much harder for Nevadans to afford their health care.\n\nI\u2019m fighting to lower health care costs for all Nevadans. I want to hear how these skyrocketing costs have impacted you and your family \u2b07\ufe0f\n\nhttps://t.co/N3470quKju",
