                "text": "Nevadans could see their premiums jump from $595 \u2192 $2,021 a month \u2014 a $1,425 increase for the SAME plan!\n\nThat is what this shutdown is about. Families in Nevada can\u2019t afford these hikes. https://t.co/rG3EQB27y6",
