                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "No one should have to choose between putting food on the table and getting the care they need. Nevada nurses like Brian Hansen see firsthand what happens when families lose their coverage.\u00a0\n\nI\u2019m fighting to make health care more affordable for Nevadans. We cannot afford to lose the ACA Tax Credits and let\u00a0health costs skyrocket.",
