                "text": "Sara is self-employed. She and her husband rely on Nevada Health Link for health coverage \u2014 but if the ACA tax credits expire, their premiums will more than double. That would be devastating for their family.\n\nWe can\u2019t let hardworking Nevadans lose the coverage they depend on. I\u2019m fighting to protect health care \ud83d\udcaa",
