                "text": "Health care is already too expensive for families in southern Nevada. Now, millions of Americans might lose health coverage entirely because of Republicans in Washington.\n\nHeather is a mom in Nevada who needs the ACA Tax Credit to afford health care. I\u2019m working to save the tax credits she uses to keep her family covered and lower costs for all Americans. Instead of letting us pass legislation to protect health care, Speaker Johnson has kept House Republicans out of D.C. for over a month.",
